          "art_direction_en": "Create a professional 3:4 Russian marketplace poster with one dominant empty woven organizer basket shown in a three-quarter top view. Use a warm light-beige studio background with a subtle natural textile or matte plaster texture, leaving generous clean space in the upper third. Apply soft warm daylight from the upper left, gentle contact shadow, and crisp detail on the woven texture. Palette: natural straw beige, sand, warm brown, and dark espresso typography. Place a large Russian headline in the upper typography zone, with 2–3 compact factual callouts beneath it in rounded beige labels or a neat lower information block. Keep the basket large and centered in the lower two-thirds; show its internal dividers clearly. Do not use a collage, repeated product copies, lifestyle clutter, brand logos, watermarks, or decorative claims.",
