          "art_direction_en": "Create a clean professional 3:4 Russian marketplace poster with one dominant product set arranged as a single neat group in the lower half, without collage treatment or repeated product copies. Use a bright warm-white clinical lifestyle background with a subtle marble or matte tabletop, soft daylight from the upper left, gentle shadows, and a restrained palette of white, lime green, yellow, orange, and mint. Reserve the upper third for a bold Russian headline in condensed black sans-serif, with smaller factual callouts directly below in clear dark-gray sans-serif. Keep generous whitespace, use thin lime-green divider accents, and place no text over the product.",
