          "art_direction_en": "Create a professional 3:4 Russian marketplace poster with one dominant blue-and-black pet grooming tool set shown large in the center, arranged naturally as a single product presentation without collage effects or repeated copies. Use a clean pale-blue studio background with soft floor shadows and bright diffused lighting. Keep the palette blue, black, white, and metallic silver. Reserve the upper area for a bold Russian headline in a clean condensed sans-serif, place up to three short factual callouts in small rounded blocks along the lower side areas, and keep generous whitespace around the product. Emphasize the visible tooth shapes and textured handle areas with crisp detail.",
