          "art_direction_en": "Professional 3:4 Russian marketplace poster. Show one dominant black magnetic car phone holder in a three-quarter hero view, mounted on a dark premium automotive dashboard surface. Use a charcoal-to-deep-teal gradient background with subtle interior texture, soft directional studio lighting, crisp rim highlights and a restrained cyan accent glow. Place a large Russian headline in the upper left, with up to three short factual callouts beneath it in a clean vertical typography zone. Keep the product unobstructed in the center-right area; add small cyan line icons or arrows only near the base and hinge to support callouts. Use modern bold sans-serif typography in white and cyan, high contrast, generous spacing, and no collage, duplicate products or unrelated objects.",
