одготовки. В комплекте 1 эспандер бирюзового цвета.\"\n      }\n    ],\n    \"_name\": \"简介\",\n    \"_source\": \"生成文案\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"complex_id\": 0,\n    \"id\": 9048,\n    \"values\": [\n      {\n        \"value\": \"AUTO-20260917-981CFB\"\n      }\n    ],\n    \"_name\": \"型号名称（针对合并为一张商品卡片）\",\n    \"_source\": \"人工填写：型号名称（合并多变体）\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"complex_id\": 0,\n    \"id\": 4383,\n    \"values\": [\n      {\n        \"value\": \"86.0\"\n      }\n    ],\n    \"_name\": \"商品重量，克\",\n    \"_source\": \"自动工作台：商品净重\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"complex_id\": 0,\n    \"id\": 11650,\n    \"values\": [\n      {\n        \"value\": \"1\"\n      }\n    ],\n    \"_name\": \"原厂包装数量\",\n    \"_source\": \"系统默认：原厂包装数量 1\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"complex_id\": 0,\n    \"id\": 10400,\n    \"values\": [\n      {\n        \"value\": \"1 年\",\n        \"dictionary_value_id\": 970716397\n      }\n    ],\n    \"_name\": \"保证\",\n    \"_source\": \"系统默认：保证 1 年（Ozon 实时字典）\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"complex_id\": 0,\n    \"id\": 7999,\n    \"values\": [\n      {\n        \"value\": \"8.3\"\n      }\n    ],\n    \"_name\": \"直径，cm\",\n    \"_source\": \"Диаметр, см\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"complex_id\": 0,\n    \"id\": 85,\n    \"values\": [\n      {\n        \"value\": \"Нет бренда\",\n        \"dictionary_value_id\": 126745801\n      }\n    ],\n    \"_name\": \"品牌\",\n    \"_source\": \"系统锁定：无品牌\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"complex_id\": 0,\n    \"id\": 7915,\n    \"values\": [\n      {\n        \"value\": \"25\"\n      }\n    ],\n    \"_name\": \"麦克斯。负载，kg\",\n    \"_source\": \"Макс. нагрузка, кг\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"complex_id\": 0,\n    \"id\": 4389,\n    \"values\": [\n      {\n        \"value\": \"中国\",\n        \"dictionary_value_id\": 90296\n      }\n    ],\n    \"_name\": \"原产国\",\n    \"_source\": \"系统默认：原产国 中国（Ozon 实时字典）\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"complex_id\": 0,\n    \"id\": 7956,\n    \"values\": [\n      {\n        \"value\": \"8.3\"\n      }\n    ],\n    \"_name\": \"长度，厘米\",\n    \"_source\": \"Длина,