          "art_direction_en": "Create a professional 3:4 Russian marketplace poster with one dominant transparent book storage box, shown three-quarter view and filled with books. Use a bright, tidy home-study interior with a light wood tabletop, warm off-white background, subtle shelving in soft focus, and natural daylight from the left. Keep a restrained palette of warm white, light wood, black product trim, and muted book-spine accents. Reserve the upper-left area for a large bold black sans-serif Russian headline; place up to three short factual callouts below it in a clean vertical stack with small line icons. Keep the product large in the lower-right to center area, fully readable and unobstructed. Do not use a collage, repeated product copies, badges, logos, excessive decorative elements, or unsupported claims.",
